      "sources": [
        "Kempner Institute nvidia-hpc-benchmarks: STREAM triad on H100 SXM reaches ~3.12 of 3.35 TB/s (brief §7.1)",
        "Applied to every memory-bound kernel, so a GEMM at M = 1 is assumed to stream its weights as well as STREAM does"
